    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34481" root="فلح" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَلْحٌ</span></b>  <i>A fissure, cleft, slit,</i> or <i>crack:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلُوحٌ</span>.
(Msb.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى رِجْلِهِ فُلُوحٌ</span> <i>In his</i> (a man's,
S) <i>foot are fissures,</i> or <i>cracks,</i> (S, K, TA,) <i>preduced by cold:</i> (TA:) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلُوجٌ</span>. (S, TA.)

